(7525645, 1202413, 12611, '<td valign="top">This works really well. One that you can come back to.</td>', 'This works really well. One that you can come back to.', '2017-07-26 13:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525646, 1202505, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love that this is a close-up of the character of water, it''s passive reflectability and the nuanced tones of its contours.  It''s something we''ve all been fascinated by, one of life''s simple pleasures.  The choice of black and white only enhances this mesmerizing image.</td>', 'I love that this is a close-up of the character of water, it''s passive reflectability and the nuanced tones of its contours.  It''s something we''ve all been fascinated by, one of life''s simple pleasures.  The choice of black and white only enhances this mesmerizing image.', '2017-07-26 13:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525648, 1202603, 12611, '<td valign="top">Georgia O''keefe fans will love this one...</td>', 'Georgia O''keefe fans will love this one...', '2017-07-26 13:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525649, 1202780, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  Love that squint!</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  Love that squint!', '2017-07-26 13:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525650, 1202829, 12611, '<td valign="top">creepy, like fingers and antlers- or rib cages...</td>', 'creepy, like fingers and antlers- or rib cages...', '2017-07-26 13:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525651, 1202854, 173844, '<td valign="top">Such a curious looking creature close up, part vulture part peacock, in this moment, scratching out its existence.  A bold composition that serves the subject well.  Nicely seen.</td>', 'Such a curious looking creature close up, part vulture part peacock, in this moment, scratching out its existence.  A bold composition that serves the subject well.  Nicely seen.', '2017-07-26 13:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525652, 1202840, 173844, '<td valign="top">Never saw such an elegant portrayal of a toothbrush.  This is how angels clean their teeth.</td>', 'Never saw such an elegant portrayal of a toothbrush.  This is how angels clean their teeth.', '2017-07-26 13:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525653, 1202609, 173844, '<td valign="top">Gritty and powerful, great texture, almost sensual.  Scrutiny only makes it more so.</td>', 'Gritty and powerful, great texture, almost sensual.  Scrutiny only makes it more so.', '2017-07-26 13:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525654, 1202839, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely, with perfect depth of field to elicit the appearance of the rest of the web as the surface of a planet, the spider''s world.  Great colors and composition.</td>', 'Lovely, with perfect depth of field to elicit the appearance of the rest of the web as the surface of a planet, the spider''s world.  Great colors and composition.', '2017-07-26 13:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525655, 1202527, 173844, '<td valign="top">One of the most interesting flower images I''ve ever seen.</td>', 'One of the most interesting flower images I''ve ever seen.', '2017-07-26 13:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525656, 1202871, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine image of a prehistoric beast gliding smoothly along the brink of extinction.</td>', 'Fine image of a prehistoric beast gliding smoothly along the brink of extinction.', '2017-07-26 13:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525658, 1202848, 173844, '<td valign="top">Is this too wide a scene to be considered "tight"?  I don''t think so, because there is a "rest" of the image that informs and frames this gleefully caught moment, which itself is tightly framed within time.  And it''s a great photograph.</td>', 'Is this too wide a scene to be considered "tight"?  I don''t think so, because there is a "rest" of the image that informs and frames this gleefully caught moment, which itself is tightly framed within time.  And it''s a great photograph.', '2017-07-26 13:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525659, 1202603, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well done example of the sliced food genre.</td>', 'Well done example of the sliced food genre.', '2017-07-26 13:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525661, 1202677, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well-framed, well-composed and well-focused.  Now that I''m out of hyphens, it''s also beautifully understated.</td>', 'Well-framed, well-composed and well-focused.  Now that I''m out of hyphens, it''s also beautifully understated.', '2017-07-26 13:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525662, 1202885, 173844, '<td valign="top">Moody, handsome portrait.  Nice tones and balance.  May want medical assistance for that camera stuck in his eye.</td>', 'Moody, handsome portrait.  Nice tones and balance.  May want medical assistance for that camera stuck in his eye.', '2017-07-26 13:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525664, 1202612, 173844, '<td valign="top">Bold and brassy.  Maybe a trifle over-saturated.</td>', 'Bold and brassy.  Maybe a trifle over-saturated.', '2017-07-26 13:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525665, 1202873, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice high-key portrait.  What I really like is how the vegetation seems to balance and complement the unshown portion of her face.</td>', 'Very nice high-key portrait.  What I really like is how the vegetation seems to balance and complement the unshown portion of her face.', '2017-07-26 13:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7525666, 1202414, 173844, '<td valign="top">Graphically elegant and luscious.</td>', 'Graphically elegant and luscious.', '2017-07-26 13:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
