(7525886, 1202874, 65234, '<td valign="top">Congrats, Ken! Love those blue eyes, and the mischievous look on his face.</td>', 'Congrats, Ken! Love those blue eyes, and the mischievous look on his face.', '2017-07-28 09:41:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525888, 1202395, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF! Unusual to see focus just on the wing, but it makes it much more interesting to me. Congrats on the yellow.</td>', 'Love the DOF! Unusual to see focus just on the wing, but it makes it much more interesting to me. Congrats on the yellow.', '2017-07-28 09:43:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525889, 1202850, 65234, '<td valign="top">Two parrots on the front page :-) Yours is much more colorful and I love the curves. Nice job and congrats on the HM.</td>', 'Two parrots on the front page :-) Yours is much more colorful and I love the curves. Nice job and congrats on the HM.', '2017-07-28 09:45:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525892, 1202414, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interestng image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>Nicely done Marcel. This is a lovely strong graphical image with bold colours and good composition. Technically everything is good, accurate focus and DOF against a nice plain background with the fork very nicely lit and contrasted against the bold red of the fruit and blending in nicely with the background. The seeds break up the foreground nicely too, all in all a very pleasing result, well done.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interestng image that meets the challenge well. Nicely done Marcel. This is a lovely strong graphical image with bold colours and good composition. Technically everything is good, accurate focus and DOF against a nice plain background with the fork very nicely lit and contrasted against the bold red of the fruit and blending in nicely with the background. The seeds break up the foreground nicely too, all in all a very pleasing result, well done.', '2017-07-28 10:08:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7525893, 1202395, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>Wow GinTay very nicely done, youve certainly cropped close but this works so well because you have something extraordinary and unique here. By focussing on the wing you are able to show us the intricate delicate detail of the wing whilst keeping the insect itself in soft focus, this makes for a marvellous perspective that is so out of keeping with the normal approach, I like it a lot. Congratulations for such a well deserved result and ribbon for such a wonderful image, thank you for sharing.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that meets the challenge well. Wow GinTay very nicely done, youve certainly cropped close but this works so well because you have something extraordinary and unique here. By focussing on the wing you are able to show us the intricate delicate detail of the wing whilst keeping the insect itself in soft focus, this makes for a marvellous perspective that is so out of keeping with the normal approach, I like it a lot. Congratulations for such a well deserved result and ribbon for such a wonderful image, thank you for sharing.', '2017-07-28 10:14:15.000000', NULL, 0),
